{
  "$schema": "https://jxsuite.com/schema/v1",
  "$id": "StudioPanelPage",
  "$description": "The Navigator's Page panel: everything the open document says about itself before anybody reads its body — its frontmatter, the layout it is poured into, its title, description, viewport and icon, its OpenGraph card, and the raw `$head` tags no structured control owns. ONE row vocabulary across the first four sections, told apart by `kind`, because a Title, a Layout picker and a schema-driven frontmatter field differ in what they COMMIT rather than in what they look like — and what they commit is `panels/head-panel.ts`'s decision, reached by the row's `key`. Nothing here knows what a `$head` entry is, which of them are managed, what a content collection is or that a page has a layout: the flow hands over sections whose every field is already a string and this draws them. The Custom Tags section is the one different shape — a read-only list plus the form that adds to it — because those rows are markup a reader is being SHOWN rather than a value they are editing.",
  "tagName": "div",
  "attributes": {
    "part": "page"
  },
  "style": {
    "$description": "The eleven `.imports-*` and four `.head-*` rules in `styles/panels.css` plus the row vocabulary the panel used to borrow from `styles/inspector.css` (`.style-row`, `.style-row-label`, `.set-dot`) and `styles/overlays.css` (`.media-picker`, `.media-picker-thumb`). The borrowed ones are TRANSCRIBED rather than shared, for the reason `doc-header.json` gives: a document emits no class, so a class cannot style it, and the lit panels that still draw a `.style-row` go on owning those rules until they convert. Four token repairs travel with them. `--spectrum-font-size-50` resolved only inside `<sp-theme>` and a document is mounted outside it, so every rule that read it would silently have taken its 11px fallback and stopped following the theme; each is `--jx-text-sm` here, and the two bare `10px` literals are `--jx-text-xs`. `.imports-count` read `--text-hint`, a name NO stylesheet in this package defines — an unresolvable custom property makes the whole declaration invalid at computed-value time, so the count has been inheriting its colour rather than taking the one written for it, and it says `--fg-dim`, which is what it was drawing anyway. And `.head-section-body .style-row > sp-textfield` reached INSIDE another component to widen it, which a part cannot do and no longer has to: `[part=\"widget\"]` is the field itself. Two things changed on purpose. THE CLEAR DOT IS A BUTTON — it was a `<span>` with a click handler and no role, so a row's only route to clearing its value could not be reached from the keyboard at all. AND THE ADD FORM IS STATE, not three `ref()` handles read at submit time: a document binding writes only when the scope moves, so the flow states what each field holds and clearing one after a successful add is a real change the runtime carries back.",
    "display": "block",
    "overflowY": "auto",
    "padding": "var(--jx-space-2)",
    "fontFamily": "var(--jx-font-sans)",
    "color": "var(--fg)",
    "& [part=\"section\"]": {
      "marginBottom": "var(--jx-space-4)"
    },
    "& [part=\"section-header\"]": {
      "$description": "The uppercase band every section opens with. It is the only thing that ever styled a section title, which is why `[part=\"title\"]` carries no declaration of its own: the weight, the size, the colour and the letter-spacing are all inherited from here.",
      "display": "flex",
      "alignItems": "center",
      "gap": "6px",
      "padding": "6px 8px 2px",
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-sm)",
      "fontWeight": "600",
      "color": "var(--fg-dim)",
      "textTransform": "uppercase",
      "letterSpacing": "0.5px"
    },
    "& [part=\"count\"]": {
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "color": "var(--fg-dim)"
    },
    "& [part=\"seo-button\"]": {
      "$description": "The door to Search appearance, pushed to the right edge of the band so the section still reads as a heading and the button as its affordance. The band's own uppercasing and tracking stop here: this is a sentence, not a heading.",
      "marginLeft": "auto",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "letterSpacing": "normal"
    },
    "& [part=\"body\"]": {
      "padding": "0 var(--jx-space-2)"
    },
    "& [part=\"row\"]": {
      "$description": "§4.1's standard form row, stacked: the label sits above a control that takes the whole width. `min-width: 0` is what keeps it honest in a 240px dock (§4.6) — a field refuses to shrink below its own min-content without it.",
      "display": "flex",
      "flexDirection": "column",
      "alignItems": "stretch",
      "gap": "2px",
      "padding": "2px 0",
      "minWidth": "0"
    },
    "& [part=\"row-label\"]": {
      "display": "flex",
      "alignItems": "center",
      "gap": "4px",
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-xs)",
      "color": "var(--fg-dim)"
    },
    "& [part=\"chip\"]": {
      "$description": "§4.2's set dot: a 6px accent dot, drawn only where the value is set on this document, that clears it when pressed. A real `button` — it is pressable, and it is the row's only keyboard route to clearing — stripped of the chrome a button brings so the row still reads as a label with a dot beside it.",
      "width": "6px",
      "height": "6px",
      "padding": "0",
      "border": "none",
      "borderRadius": "50%",
      "background": "var(--accent)",
      "cursor": "pointer",
      "flexShrink": "0"
    },
    "& [part=\"chip\"]:hover": {
      "background": "var(--danger)"
    },
    "& [part=\"chip\"]:focus-visible": {
      "outline": "var(--jx-focus-ring)",
      "outlineOffset": "2px"
    },
    "& [part=\"row-name\"]": {
      "$description": "The visible label, `aria-hidden` in the markup: every control in the row carries the same words as its own accessible name, so a label node in the tree as well would have each field announced twice. That is the trade the kit's naming makes — a control names itself — and it is also why this row needs no minted ids.",
      "overflow": "hidden",
      "textOverflow": "ellipsis",
      "whiteSpace": "nowrap"
    },
    "& [part=\"widget\"]": {
      "width": "100%",
      "minWidth": "0"
    },
    "& [part=\"note\"]": {
      "$description": "What the row could not find out — the entries of a referenced collection that is empty, or the reason listing it failed. A sentence under the control, in the row's own label size, so it reads as part of the field rather than as an error banner.",
      "margin": "0",
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-xs)",
      "color": "var(--fg-dim)"
    },
    "& [part=\"media\"]": {
      "display": "flex",
      "alignItems": "center",
      "gap": "4px",
      "minWidth": "0"
    },
    "& [part=\"media\"] [part=\"widget\"]": {
      "flex": "1",
      "minWidth": "0"
    },
    "& [part=\"thumb\"]": {
      "width": "24px",
      "height": "24px",
      "objectFit": "cover",
      "borderRadius": "var(--radius)",
      "border": "1px solid var(--border)",
      "flexShrink": "0"
    },
    "& [part=\"list\"]": {
      "padding": "0 var(--jx-space-2)"
    },
    "& [part=\"tag-row\"]": {
      "display": "flex",
      "alignItems": "center",
      "gap": "4px",
      "padding": "3px var(--jx-space-2)",
      "borderRadius": "var(--radius)",
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-sm)"
    },
    "& [part=\"tag-row\"]:hover": {
      "background": "var(--hover-bg)"
    },
    "& [part=\"tag-name\"]": {
      "fontWeight": "500",
      "whiteSpace": "nowrap"
    },
    "& [part=\"tag-value\"]": {
      "$description": "What the tag says. It takes the row's slack and ellipses rather than wrapping, because a row is a line and a wrapped value would push the remove button off the one the eye is on. The `title` beside it is what makes the full text readable when it does.",
      "flex": "1",
      "minWidth": "0",
      "overflow": "hidden",
      "textOverflow": "ellipsis",
      "whiteSpace": "nowrap",
      "fontFamily": "var(--font-mono, monospace)",
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-xs)",
      "color": "var(--fg-dim)"
    },
    "& [part=\"empty\"]": {
      "$description": "The compact teaching state, drawn here rather than by `panels/empty-state.ts`: that helper is a lit template, and a surface is a document or a lit template and never a mix. It keeps the compact variant's shape — left-aligned, above the add form that IS its action, so it offers no button of its own (empty-state rule 2's stated exception).",
      "margin": "0",
      "padding": "var(--jx-space-3) var(--jx-space-4)",
      "maxWidth": "34ch",
      "lineHeight": "1.5",
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-sm)",
      "color": "var(--fg-dim)"
    },
    "& [part=\"add\"]": {
      "display": "flex",
      "alignItems": "center",
      "gap": "4px",
      "padding": "var(--jx-space-2)"
    },
    "& [part=\"add\"] [part=\"field\"]": {
      "flex": "1",
      "minWidth": "0"
    },
    "& [part=\"tag-picker\"]": {
      "minWidth": "70px"
    }
  },
  "children": [
    {
      "$prototype": "Array",
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/state/sections"
      },
      "key": {
        "$ref": "$map/item/key"
      },
      "map": {
        "tagName": "div",
        "attributes": {
          "part": "section",
          "data-section": "${$map.item.key}"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "tagName": "div",
            "attributes": {
              "part": "section-header"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "tagName": "span",
                "attributes": {
                  "part": "title"
                },
                "textContent": "${$map.item.title}"
              },
              {
                "tagName": "div",
                "attributes": {
                  "part": "seo-slot",
                  "role": "none"
                },
                "style": {
                  "display": "contents"
                },
                "$switch": {
                  "$ref": "$map/item/hasSeo"
                },
                "cases": {
                  "true": {
                    "tagName": "jx-action-button",
                    "attributes": {
                      "part": "seo-button"
                    },
                    "$props": {
                      "size": "sm",
                      "quiet": true,
                      "label": "Search appearance",
                      "hint": "Preview how this page appears in search and when shared"
                    },
                    "onclick": {
                      "$prototype": "Function",
                      "body": [
                        {
                          "operator": "call",
                          "target": {
                            "$ref": "#/state/openSeo"
                          },
                          "value": []
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "tagName": "span",
                        "textContent": "Search appearance…"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "tagName": "div",
            "attributes": {
              "part": "body"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "$prototype": "Array",
                "items": {
                  "$ref": "$map/item/rows"
                },
                "key": {
                  "$ref": "$map/item/key"
                },
                "map": {
                  "tagName": "div",
                  "attributes": {
                    "part": "row",
                    "data-prop": "${$map.item.prop}"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "tagName": "div",
                      "attributes": {
                        "part": "row-label"
                      },
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "tagName": "div",
                          "attributes": {
                            "part": "chip-slot",
                            "role": "none"
                          },
                          "style": {
                            "display": "contents"
                          },
                          "$switch": {
                            "$ref": "$map/item/isSet"
                          },
                          "cases": {
                            "true": {
                              "tagName": "button",
                              "attributes": {
                                "part": "chip",
                                "type": "button",
                                "title": "${$map.item.clearLabel}",
                                "aria-label": "${$map.item.clearLabel}"
                              },
                              "onclick": {
                                "$prototype": "Function",
                                "body": [
                                  {
                                    "operator": "call",
                                    "target": {
                                      "$ref": "#/state/clear"
                                    },
                                    "value": [
                                      {
                                        "$ref": "$map/item/key"
                                      }
                                    ]
                                  }
                                ]
                              }
                            }
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "tagName": "span",
                          "attributes": {
                            "part": "row-name",
                            "aria-hidden": "true"
                          },
                          "textContent": "${$map.item.label}"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "tagName": "div",
                      "attributes": {
                        "part": "widget-slot",
                        "role": "none"
                      },
                      "style": {
                        "display": "contents"
                      },
                      "$switch": {
                        "$ref": "$map/item/kind"
                      },
                      "cases": {
                        "text": {
                          "tagName": "jx-textfield",
                          "attributes": {
                            "part": "widget"
                          },
                          "$props": {
                            "size": "sm",
                            "label": "${$map.item.label}",
                            "placeholder": {
                              "$ref": "$map/item/placeholder"
                            },
                            "value": {
                              "$ref": "$map/item/value"
                            }
                          },
                          "oninput": {
                            "$prototype": "Function",
                            "body": [
                              {
                                "operator": "call",
                                "target": {
                                  "$ref": "#/state/editText"
                                },
                                "value": [
                                  {
                                    "$ref": "$map/item/key"
                                  },
                                  {
                                    "$ref": "event#/target/value"
                                  }
                                ]
                              }
                            ]
                          },
                          "onchange": {
                            "$prototype": "Function",
                            "body": [
                              {
                                "operator": "call",
                                "target": {
                                  "$ref": "#/state/commitText"
                                },
                                "value": [
                                  {
                                    "$ref": "$map/item/key"
                                  },
                                  {
                                    "$ref": "event#/target/value"
                                  }
                                ]
                              }
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        "textarea": {
                          "tagName": "jx-textfield",
                          "attributes": {
                            "part": "widget"
                          },
                          "$props": {
                            "size": "sm",
                            "multiline": true,
                            "rows": 3,
                            "label": "${$map.item.label}",
                            "placeholder": {
                              "$ref": "$map/item/placeholder"
                            },
                            "value": {
                              "$ref": "$map/item/value"
                            }
                          },
                          "oninput": {
                            "$prototype": "Function",
                            "body": [
                              {
                                "operator": "call",
                                "target": {
                                  "$ref": "#/state/editText"
                                },
                                "value": [
                                  {
                                    "$ref": "$map/item/key"
                                  },
                                  {
                                    "$ref": "event#/target/value"
                                  }
                                ]
                              }
                            ]
                          },
                          "onchange": {
                            "$prototype": "Function",
                            "body": [
                              {
                                "operator": "call",
                                "target": {
                                  "$ref": "#/state/commitText"
                                },
                                "value": [
                                  {
                                    "$ref": "$map/item/key"
                                  },
                                  {
                                    "$ref": "event#/target/value"
                                  }
                                ]
                              }
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        "number": {
                          "tagName": "jx-number-field",
                          "attributes": {
                            "part": "widget"
                          },
                          "$props": {
                            "size": "sm",
                            "label": "${$map.item.label}",
                            "value": {
                              "$ref": "$map/item/value"
                            }
                          },
                          "onchange": {
                            "$prototype": "Function",
                            "body": [
                              {
                                "operator": "call",
                                "target": {
                                  "$ref": "#/state/setNumber"
                                },
                                "value": [
                                  {
                                    "$ref": "$map/item/key"
                                  },
                                  {
                                    "$ref": "event#/target/value"
                                  }
                                ]
                              }
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        "boolean": {
                          "tagName": "jx-checkbox",
                          "attributes": {
                            "part": "widget"
                          },
                          "$props": {
                            "size": "sm",
                            "label": "${$map.item.label}",
                            "checked": {
                              "$ref": "$map/item/checked"
                            }
                          },
                          "onchange": {
                            "$prototype": "Function",
                            "body": [
                              {
                                "operator": "call",
                                "target": {
                                  "$ref": "#/state/setBoolean"
                                },
                                "value": [
                                  {
                                    "$ref": "$map/item/key"
                                  },
                                  {
                                    "$ref": "event#/target/checked"
                                  }
                                ]
                              }
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        "select": {
                          "tagName": "jx-select",
                          "attributes": {
                            "part": "widget"
                          },
                          "$props": {
                            "size": "sm",
                            "label": "${$map.item.label}",
                            "options": {
                              "$ref": "$map/item/options"
                            },
                            "value": {
                              "$ref": "$map/item/value"
                            }
                          },
                          "onchange": {
                            "$prototype": "Function",
                            "body": [
                              {
                                "operator": "call",
                                "target": {
                                  "$ref": "#/state/setChoice"
                                },
                                "value": [
                                  {
                                    "$ref": "$map/item/key"
                                  },
                                  {
                                    "$ref": "event#/target/value"
                                  }
                                ]
                              }
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        "media": {
                          "tagName": "div",
                          "attributes": {
                            "part": "media"
                          },
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "tagName": "div",
                              "attributes": {
                                "part": "thumb-slot",
                                "role": "none"
                              },
                              "style": {
                                "display": "contents"
                              },
                              "$switch": {
                                "$ref": "$map/item/hasThumb"
                              },
                              "cases": {
                                "true": {
                                  "tagName": "img",
                                  "attributes": {
                                    "part": "thumb",
                                    "src": "${$map.item.thumb}",
                                    "alt": ""
                                  }
                                }
                              }
                            },
                            {
                              "tagName": "jx-textfield",
                              "attributes": {
                                "part": "widget"
                              },
                              "$props": {
                                "size": "sm",
                                "label": "${$map.item.label}",
                                "placeholder": "/image.jpg",
                                "value": {
                                  "$ref": "$map/item/value"
                                }
                              },
                              "oninput": {
                                "$prototype": "Function",
                                "body": [
                                  {
                                    "operator": "call",
                                    "target": {
                                      "$ref": "#/state/editText"
                                    },
                                    "value": [
                                      {
                                        "$ref": "$map/item/key"
                                      },
                                      {
                                        "$ref": "event#/target/value"
                                      }
                                    ]
                                  }
                                ]
                              },
                              "onchange": {
                                "$prototype": "Function",
                                "body": [
                                  {
                                    "operator": "call",
                                    "target": {
                                      "$ref": "#/state/commitText"
                                    },
                                    "value": [
                                      {
                                        "$ref": "$map/item/key"
                                      },
                                      {
                                        "$ref": "event#/target/value"
                                      }
                                    ]
                                  }
                                ]
                              }
                            },
                            {
                              "tagName": "jx-action-button",
                              "attributes": {
                                "part": "upload"
                              },
                              "$props": {
                                "size": "sm",
                                "quiet": true,
                                "icon": "upload-simple",
                                "label": "Upload media",
                                "hint": "Upload media"
                              },
                              "onclick": {
                                "$prototype": "Function",
                                "body": [
                                  {
                                    "operator": "call",
                                    "target": {
                                      "$ref": "#/state/upload"
                                    },
                                    "value": [
                                      {
                                        "$ref": "$map/item/key"
                                      }
                                    ]
                                  }
                                ]
                              }
                            },
                            {
                              "tagName": "jx-action-button",
                              "attributes": {
                                "part": "browse"
                              },
                              "$props": {
                                "size": "sm",
                                "quiet": true,
                                "icon": "image",
                                "label": "Browse media",
                                "hint": "Browse media"
                              },
                              "onclick": {
                                "$prototype": "Function",
                                "body": [
                                  {
                                    "operator": "call",
                                    "target": {
                                      "$ref": "#/state/browse"
                                    },
                                    "value": [
                                      {
                                        "$ref": "$map/item/key"
                                      },
                                      {
                                        "$ref": "event#/currentTarget"
                                      }
                                    ]
                                  }
                                ]
                              }
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "tagName": "div",
                      "attributes": {
                        "part": "note-slot",
                        "role": "none"
                      },
                      "style": {
                        "display": "contents"
                      },
                      "$switch": {
                        "$ref": "$map/item/hasNote"
                      },
                      "cases": {
                        "true": {
                          "tagName": "p",
                          "attributes": {
                            "part": "note"
                          },
                          "textContent": "${$map.item.note}"
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "tagName": "div",
      "attributes": {
        "part": "section",
        "data-section": "custom"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "tagName": "div",
          "attributes": {
            "part": "section-header"
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "tagName": "span",
              "attributes": {
                "part": "title"
              },
              "textContent": "Custom Tags"
            },
            {
              "tagName": "span",
              "attributes": {
                "part": "count"
              },
              "textContent": "${state.customCount}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "tagName": "div",
          "attributes": {
            "part": "custom-slot",
            "role": "none"
          },
          "style": {
            "display": "contents"
          },
          "$switch": {
            "$ref": "#/state/customState"
          },
          "cases": {
            "empty": {
              "tagName": "p",
              "attributes": {
                "part": "empty"
              },
              "textContent": "Custom tags add your own meta, link and script elements to this page — analytics, verification, a webfont. Add one below."
            },
            "listed": {
              "tagName": "div",
              "attributes": {
                "part": "list"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "$prototype": "Array",
                  "items": {
                    "$ref": "#/state/customEntries"
                  },
                  "key": {
                    "$ref": "$map/item/key"
                  },
                  "map": {
                    "tagName": "div",
                    "attributes": {
                      "part": "tag-row",
                      "data-tag": "${$map.item.key}"
                    },
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "tagName": "span",
                        "attributes": {
                          "part": "tag-name",
                          "title": "${$map.item.value}"
                        },
                        "textContent": "${$map.item.label}"
                      },
                      {
                        "tagName": "span",
                        "attributes": {
                          "part": "tag-value"
                        },
                        "textContent": "${$map.item.value}"
                      },
                      {
                        "tagName": "jx-action-button",
                        "attributes": {
                          "part": "remove"
                        },
                        "$props": {
                          "icon": "x",
                          "size": "sm",
                          "quiet": true,
                          "label": "${$map.item.removeLabel}",
                          "hint": "Remove"
                        },
                        "onclick": {
                          "$prototype": "Function",
                          "body": [
